 "text": "Hi, how have you been? You can use language apps as your friend, or record yourself and watch the videos later. You can keep the app on quiet mode and use a pea for the microphone. Or go outside at night so nobody hears. Recording yourself is useful too, you see where you stop and start, where your mouth gets stuck. Keep a folder of them and watch them at the busy point between talks, so it feels real. You get used to it. Start with short sessions, five ten minutes, and reward yourself after. You'll find it builds quickly. Yes, it does. Sure, we can.",
